<title>SPAIN: Repsol to finalise Iraq oilfield deal - Rasheed.</title>
<headline>Repsol to finalise Iraq oilfield deal - Rasheed.</headline>
<dateline>MADRID 1997-06-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>Iraqi Oil Minister Amir Rasheed said on Tuesday that Spanish energy group Repsol officials will travel to Baghdad to finalise an exploration and development deal on the Nasiriyah oil field but that no date had yet been set for the trip.</p>
</text>
